{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道光靠继续行动还不够，却舍不得松手，怕承认那次决定不够，就连它曾帮他走出犹疑也不算数了。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得松手\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记那种不用时时防备的亲近，心里一软，又把心思拉回自己定下的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"不用时时防备\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"一想到停下就像辜负最初的决意，他便认定眼下难受只是自己还在迟疑，逼自己继续撑。\",\n      \"key\": \"辜负最初的决意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他把坚持变成不许示弱的规矩，连自己累了都不肯认，后来发现自己只是在逼一个累了的人证明够坚强。\",\n      \"key\": \"不许示弱\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己硬撑，心里仍不安，也有些茫然，才肯承认舍不得那种不必防备的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\", \"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\", \"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分重写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动仍不够却舍不得松手的矛盾。把抽象的怕失望说明变心，改成怕承认决定不够就连它曾帮他走出犹疑也不算数；另写明停下像辜负决意，以及把眼下难受误当成自己还在迟疑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\", \"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并落地\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不许示弱、连疲惫都不肯认，到发现自己正在逼一个累了的人证明坚强的递进。用这个具体发现替代重复的坚定与坚强说法，保留他不愿再这样硬撑的转折。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\", \"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留放下催逼并未立刻安心、茫然松动后才承认不舍的过程。把抽象的舍不得的东西具体为一直想要的不必防备的生活，让S06对这份依恋的辨认有明确的前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1508c39b-442e-4ea4-aa6d-c9ce560d4059", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163511024480Z", "elapsed_seconds": 844.157, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:49:15.182804+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "65a47896cf2944e3fd907645bab3c18e1800e5184679c0ea4deec3ed63e04b13", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a73